=== 80x30 ===
abacus   Board  [Tasks]  Leases  Queues  Doctor
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Keys

  What the Insights numbers mean
  Next picks: ready work ranked by how much it unblocks and how urgent it is.
  'unblocks N' counts the tasks waiting on it; the reasons show under the
  selected row.
  Blockers to clear: open work other tasks are waiting on, the most-blocking
  first.
  Bottlenecks (betweenness): tasks that sit on the most dependency paths
  between other tasks. A high value means a delay here ripples through many
  chains.
  Critical path (impact depth): tasks ranked by how long a chain of work hangs
  off them. The top ones set the minimum time left.
  Influence (centrality): a PageRank-style score, higher when important tasks
  depend on a task. It finds well-connected keystones the other two can miss.
  Cycles: tasks that wait on each other in a loop. None of them can become
  ready until one link is removed; the critical path is skipped while a cycle
  exists.
  Parallel tracks: groups of ready work that do not depend on each other, so
  they can proceed side by side.
  s changes the row order (rank, id, title), S reverses it, enter opens the
  task in the List, g shows its graph.

  tab/→         next tab
  shift+tab/←   prev tab
  1-9           jump to tab
  ↕ +27 more
